  id: sekhara
  dexNumber: 208
  displayName: Sekhara
  lore: The dunes remember a queen with a lioness's head who carried the evening
    sun on her brow. She walks them still, tall and unhurried, and what her shadow
    falls on at dusk does not see morning.
  personality: Regal, exacting, merciless to the disrespectful.
